    <section class="section section-soft" id="why-these-countries">
      <div class="shell">
        <div class="section-heading wide">
          <p class="eyebrow">Why these countries</p>
          <h2>Where independent assessments show the greatest need.</h2>
          <p>We have named these nine areas because they are among the places with the greatest humanitarian need in 2026, according to published assessments by the United Nations and other humanitarian organisations. Nine of the ten countries ranked highest on the International Rescue Committee's 2026 Emergency Watchlist are on our list. Globally, the UN's Global Humanitarian Overview 2026 estimated that 239 million people needed humanitarian assistance, and by April 2026 less than a quarter of the money it asked for had been received.</p>
          <p>Other countries also have very serious needs. This list is where we have started, not a claim that these are the only places that matter. It will change as trustees review the evidence each year.</p>
        </div>
