        <p class="small-print">Overall ranking: <a class="text-link" href="https://www.rescue.org/article/top-10-crises-world-cant-ignore-2026" rel="noopener">International Rescue Committee, Emergency Watchlist 2026</a>. Global figures: <a class="text-link" href="https://humanitarianaction.info/document/global-humanitarian-overview-2026" rel="noopener">UN OCHA, Global Humanitarian Overview 2026</a>. These are estimates published by the organisations named, not RallyGood's own assessments. Figures were checked in November 2026 and some will have changed since. Need is not the only test: a Drop only opens where trustees can find a verified partner and a safe way to deliver.</p>
